---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Contact — SENTINEL MAN" description="Reach the Sentinel Man team. We respond within 48 hours AEST.">
  <div class="prose-wrap">
    <div class="prose-eyebrow">CONTACT</div>
    <h1 class="prose-title">One channel. <strong>One inbox.</strong></h1>
    <div class="prose-meta">
      <span>RESPONSE WITHIN 48 HOURS AEST · MON–FRI</span>
    </div>

    <div class="prose">
      <p style="font-size:18px;color:var(--text);margin-bottom:32px">
        <a href="mailto:support@sentinelman.com" style="font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;letter-spacing:0.04em">support@sentinelman.com</a>
      </p>

      <h2>What to include</h2>
      <p>The more context you give us, the faster we can help.</p>

      <div class="contact-grid">
        <div class="contact-card">
          <div class="contact-card-title">ACCOUNT &amp; SUBSCRIPTION</div>
          <p>Include the email address on your account and a brief description of the problem. Do not include your password.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="contact-card">
          <div class="contact-card-title">BILLING &amp; REFUNDS</div>
          <p>Include your account email and the date of the charge. iOS and Android subscription refunds must be requested through Apple or Google directly.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="contact-card">
          <div class="contact-card-title">TECHNICAL PROBLEMS</div>
          <p>Include device type, OS version, and app version (Settings → About). A screenshot helps if the issue is visual.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="contact-card">
          <div class="contact-card-title">EVERYTHING ELSE</div>
          <p>Write to us as you would to a person. We read every message.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <h2>Response times</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>General enquiries — within <strong>48 hours AEST</strong></li>
        <li>Account and billing — within <strong>48 hours AEST</strong></li>
        <li>Privacy and data requests — within <strong>5 business days AEST</strong></li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Crisis support</h2>
      <p>SENTINEL MAN is a performance intelligence system. If you are experiencing a mental health crisis, please contact a qualified service immediately.</p>
      <ul class="crisis-list">
        <li><strong>Lifeline</strong><span>13 11 14</span></li>
        <li><strong>Beyond Blue</strong><span>1300 22 4636</span></li>
        <li><strong>MensLine Australia</strong><span>1300 78 99 78</span></li>
        <li><strong>Suicide Call Back Service</strong><span>1300 659 467</span></li>
        <li><strong>Emergency services</strong><span>000</span></li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Press &amp; media</h2>
      <p>For press enquiries, interview requests, and media coverage:<br /><a href="mailto:support@sentinelman.com?subject=PRESS">support@sentinelman.com</a> — mark your subject line <code>PRESS</code>.</p>

      <hr />
      <p style="text-align:center;font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;letter-spacing:0.08em">MY COSMIC MESSAGE PTY LTD · ABN 30 652 358 159 · SYDNEY, AUSTRALIA</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
